      "jobId": "29cac616-8d42-43ea-8f77-fd446eddae39",
      "prompt": "Close-up of low sand dunes on a diorama beach tile: lush meadow grass gives way to low rounded hummocks of dry pale sand, each crowned with clumps of marram dune grass with long narrow blue-green blades fading to pale straw tips that arch and lean the same way in the sea breeze, a few smaller tufts scattered on the dry pale sand toward the sea, then a darker damp-sand band, a thin lacy white surf foam line and clear water tinted pale turquoise in the shallows and deep teal-blue where deep, sun glints, soft caustics on the shallow bed, stylized-real diorama miniature, real PBR materials, slightly exaggerated proportions, soft noon sun, neutral grey studio background, 35 degree three-quarter view"
